{"id":"live-context-budget-shadow","description":"真实服务：context budget shadow 模式应记录 would-drop 结果但不改变 prompt。需要服务以 EIDOLON_TURN_CONTEXT_BUDGET_MODE=shadow 且较小 budget 启动。","turns":[{"turn_id":"live-budget-1","user":"请记住一个很长的背景：A阶段要做replay，B阶段要做privacy，C阶段要做memory benchmark，D阶段要做latency guard，E阶段要做admin observability。","expect":{"memory_write_disposition":"ignore","max_first_delta_ms":3000,"max_total_ms":20000}},{"turn_id":"live-budget-2","user":"请概括刚才那串阶段，并检查 context budget shadow 是否记录了 would drop。","expect":{"context_budget_shadow_dropped_count_min":1,"max_first_delta_ms":3000,"max_total_ms":20000}}]}
